translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_be966e8f:

    # "Regina smiled warmly, her eyes welling up ever so slightly before sliding out of the doorway back towards her cooking pot."
    "레지나는 따뜻하게 미소 지으며, 눈이 살짝 촉촉해지더니 문간에서 미끄러지듯 요리 냄비 쪽으로 돌아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:180
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_7e88966e:

    # "A short while later, the homely food was served and I devoured every last scrap of it."
    "잠시 후, 소박한 음식이 나왔고 나는 마지막 한 조각까지 전부 먹어치웠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:181
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_9913f732:

    # "We talked about many things, the good and the bad of my experiences with the Scouts, but I did my best to avoid discussing the fort and Duprey and Borras’ deaths."
    "우리는 많은 것을 이야기했다. 정찰대에서의 경험 중 좋았던 점과 나빴던 점을, 하지만 요새와 듀프레이와 보라스의 죽음에 대해서는 최대한 피하려고 애썼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:182
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_34f338ce:

    # "Regina informed me that Adara had visited nearly every day to find out if I’d written any letters home that she could read."
    "레지나는 아다라가 읽을 수 있는 집으로 보내는 편지를 내가 썼는지 알아보기 위해 거의 매일 방문했다고 알려줬다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:183
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_addc3724:

    # "I explained to [regina_ref!t] that I was a part of the Adventurers' guild now. It made her uncomfortable given that I had barely survived my trek with the Scouts..."
    "[regina_ref!t]에게 이제 모험가 길드 소속이라고 설명했다. 정찰대 원정에서 겨우 살아남은 걸 생각하면 그녀는 불편해했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:184
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_42e29a17:

    # "...But she didn’t let her displeasure be known through anything other than pursing her lips and going a little quiet."
    "...하지만 그녀는 입술을 삐죽이고 조용해지는 것 외에는 불만을 드러내지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:185
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_2ece8a6b:

    # "Finally, placing my bowl down onto the table, I rose from my seat."
    "마침내 그릇을 테이블에 내려놓고, 나는 자리에서 일어났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:190
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_c229410b:

    # MC @ talk "I have to go meet Markus now, we’ve got to show up at the Adventurers' Guild."
    MC @ talk "이제 마커스를 만나러 가야 해. 모험가 길드에 등장해야 하거든."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:192
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_8f36c5e5:

    # REGINA @ talk "Will you be back later?"
    REGINA @ talk "나중에 돌아올 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:193
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_5bbe96f5:

    # MC @ talk "Of course, though it might not be till quite a bit later..."
    MC @ talk "물론이지, 하지만 꽤 늦어질 수도 있어..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:194
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_a5e8ce64:

    # MC @ talk "Do you need anything?"
    MC @ talk "뭐 필요하신 거 있어요?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:195
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_21b02044:

    # REGINA @ talk "Hmm... Well, if you’re offering..."
    REGINA @ talk "흠... 뭐, 제안하는 거라면..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:196
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_66035ecd:

    # REGINA @ talk "Could you pick up something for me from the Blacksmiths?"
    REGINA @ talk "대장간에서 내 물건 좀 가져다줄 수 있어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:197
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_2f447204:

    # MC @ talk "What is it?"
    MC @ talk "뭐야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:198
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_dbff95b5:

    # MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t] blushed as she spoke but waved off the question before I could ask any more."
    MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t]가 말하면서 얼굴을 붉혔지만, 내가 더 묻기 전에 손을 흔들며 질문을 무시했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:199
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_0a2b8690:

    # REGINA @ talk "Nothing, just a little something for myself..."
    REGINA @ talk "아무것도 아니야, 그냥 나를 위한 작은 거야..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:200
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_2ded8107:

    # REGINA @ talk "It should be wrapped in a box, just tell them it’s for me."
    REGINA @ talk "상자에 포장되어 있을 거야, 그냥 나를 위한 거라고 말해줘."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:201
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_f1f0b2cc:

    # MC @ talk "Sure."
    MC @ talk "그래."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:203
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_5d0f376e:

    # MC @ talk "Well, I best get a move on."
    MC @ talk "뭐, 지금은 이만 가보는 게 좋겠어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:204
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_266a8d3f:

    # REGINA @ talk "Okay, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "알았어, 얘야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:205
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_a6585a75:

    # REGINA @ talk "Just... {i}be safe.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "그냥... {i}안전하게 있어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:207
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_8b411f76:

    # "As I was about to leave, I once again felt her press up against me."
    "떠나려는 순간, 나는 다시 한 번 그녀가 나에게 밀착하는 걸 느꼈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:208
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_00478683:

    # "Slowly, [regina_ref!t]'s embrace lessened as she let me head off and finally make my way towards Markus' house."
    "천천히, [regina_ref!t]의 포옹이 풀어졌고, 그녀는 나를 떠나보내 마침내 마커스의 집으로 향하게 했다."

translate kr strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:27
    old "Did they ask any unusual questions?"
    new "뭔가 이상한 질문을 했나?"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:37
    old "Are you okay?"
    new "괜찮아?"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:43
    old "Where is Erika?"
    new "에리카는 어디에 있나?"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:77
    old "Tell the truth."
    new "진실을 말한다."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:106
    old "Omit the truth."
    new "진실을 생략한다."

